    narr:narration """This record frames itself as [a suggested change to a position, with one comment](narr:Expr_20260928_1_ReviewCommentTinaTeammemberB4B484EaE94D4912B80BD_h8c260252a0a9_1), quoting [the review page's own display rather than the reviewer's words](narr:Expr_20260928_1_ReviewCommentTinaTeammemberB4B484EaE94D4912B80BD_h8c260252a0a9_2) before closing with [the reviewer's comment](narr:Expr_20260928_1_ReviewCommentTinaTeammemberB4B484EaE94D4912B80BD_h8c260252a0a9_3). The position asks [how the minimum gap between site cutovers is set and checked](narr:Expr_20260928_1_ReviewCommentTinaTeammemberB4B484EaE94D4912B80BD_h8c260252a0a9_4). The history shown first fixes [a two-week figure drawn from a single pilot's exception curve](narr:Expr_20260928_1_ReviewCommentTinaTeammemberB4B484EaE94D4912B80BD_h8c260252a0a9_13), even as one voice warns [the evidence is one site, one season](narr:Expr_20260928_1_ReviewCommentTinaTeammemberB4B484EaE94D4912B80BD_h8c260252a0a9_17) and another asks for [a guarantee the gap won't be compressed under schedule pressure](narr:Expr_20260928_1_ReviewCommentTinaTeammemberB4B484EaE94D4912B80BD_h8c260252a0a9_18), a request [held to](narr:Expr_20260928_1_ReviewCommentTinaTeammemberB4B484EaE94D4912B80BD_h8c260252a0a9_19). A later thread reopens it: [an admission the earlier ruling was wrong](narr:Expr_20260928_1_ReviewCommentTinaTeammemberB4B484EaE94D4912B80BD_h8c260252a0a9_9), [a re-check of the pilot's logs](narr:Expr_20260928_1_ReviewCommentTinaTeammemberB4B484EaE94D4912B80BD_h8c260252a0a9_10) that finds [the old number measured a retired batch job, not the site](narr:Expr_20260928_1_ReviewCommentTinaTeammemberB4B484EaE94D4912B80BD_h8c260252a0a9_11), landing on [a one-week figure offered as the correction](narr:Expr_20260928_1_ReviewCommentTinaTeammemberB4B484EaE94D4912B80BD_h8c260252a0a9_12) — drawing [a warning it removes the slack](narr:Expr_20260928_1_ReviewCommentTinaTeammemberB4B484EaE94D4912B80BD_h8c260252a0a9_5), [agreement that defensibility beats false comfort](narr:Expr_20260928_1_ReviewCommentTinaTeammemberB4B484EaE94D4912B80BD_h8c260252a0a9_6), [a note the new figure is tight, not safe](narr:Expr_20260928_1_ReviewCommentTinaTeammemberB4B484EaE94D4912B80BD_h8c260252a0a9_7), and [a formal supersession of the earlier note](narr:Expr_20260928_1_ReviewCommentTinaTeammemberB4B484EaE94D4912B80BD_h8c260252a0a9_8). The closing comment asks that [the revised gap name who signs off the next site](narr:Expr_20260928_1_ReviewCommentTinaTeammemberB4B484EaE94D4912B80BD_h8c260252a0a9_30), beside [a related question on sequencing cutovers under conflicting pressures](narr:Expr_20260928_1_ReviewCommentTinaTeammemberB4B484EaE94D4912B80BD_h8c260252a0a9_28).""" ;
